<title>NETHERLANDS: GUCCI net revenues by product line.</title>
<headline>GUCCI net revenues by product line.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Jan 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(in millions of U.S. dollars)</p>
<p>    Leather goods		    517.2  vs   258.3</p>
<p>    Shoes				154.7  vs    88.3</p>
<p>    Ties/scarves			40.5  vs    33.0</p>
<p>    Ready-to-wear		     75.5  vs    60.8</p>
<p>    Watches			     23.1  vs    15.4</p>
<p>    Other				 31.2  vs    16.0</p>
<p>    Royalties			   38.5  vs    28.3</p>
<p>    TOTAL				880.7  vs   500.1</p>
